Scientific HRV analysis pipeline (ECG -> R-peaks -> RR -> time HRV).
Adapted for the Alexithymia VR study (.xlsx files, Shimmer ECG at 250 Hz).
Includes full Dash interactive visualization capabilities (Time Domain only).
"""
